{"seq":1,"slug":"durable-timers","title":"持久化定时器与长等待","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/durable-timers","wordCount":1346,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"持久化定时器与长等待\">持久化定时器与长等待</h1><p>&quot;等 30 天&quot;在传统后端是个麻烦事：cron 表会膨胀、消息队列的延迟消息有上限、<code>setTimeout</code> 活不过进程重启。在持久化执行引擎里它是一等公民——<code>await sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;)</code> 就结束了，代价只有历史里的两个事件。本篇讲清这个能力的边界，以及跨月等待真正会踩到的坑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>持久化定时器（durable timer）的实现简单得出人意料：<strong>它不占用任何 Worker 或线程</strong>。<code>sleep</code> 在 Workflow 里发出一个 <code>StartTimer</code> Command，Server 记下 <code>TimerStarted</code> 事件与触发时刻，然后把这件事交给内部的定时器队列。时间到了，Server 产生 <code>TimerFired</code> 事件并把 Workflow 重新调度给某个 Worker；Worker 重放历史到 <code>sleep</code> 处，发现对应的事件是 <code>TimerFired</code>，于是继续往下执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;await sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;)&quot;] --&gt; B[发 StartTimer Command]&#10;  B --&gt; C[历史写 TimerStarted&lt;br/&gt;含 fire 时刻]&#10;  C --&gt; D[Workflow 挂起&lt;br/&gt;不占 Worker 资源]&#10;  D --&gt; E[Server 定时器队列&lt;br/&gt;持久化, 分片管理]&#10;  E --&gt;|30 天后到点| F[历史写 TimerFired]&#10;  F --&gt; G[Workflow Task 重新入队]&#10;  G --&gt; H[Worker 重放到 sleep 处]&#10;  H --&gt; I[读到 TimerFired → 继续执行]\">graph TD\n  A[\"await sleep('30 days')\"] --&gt; B[发 StartTimer Command]\n  B --&gt; C[历史写 TimerStarted&lt;br/&gt;含 fire 时刻]\n  C --&gt; D[Workflow 挂起&lt;br/&gt;不占 Worker 资源]\n  D --&gt; E[Server 定时器队列&lt;br/&gt;持久化, 分片管理]\n  E --&gt;|30 天后到点| F[历史写 TimerFired]\n  F --&gt; G[Workflow Task 重新入队]\n  G --&gt; H[Worker 重放到 sleep 处]\n  H --&gt; I[读到 TimerFired → 继续执行]</pre><p>由此得到三条与直觉相反的结论：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>等待成本与时长无关</strong>。等 1 秒和等 30 天的事件数一样、资源占用一样（挂起期间为零）。所以&quot;用轮询代替长等待&quot;在任何情况下都是错的。</li>\n<li><strong>定时器是持久的</strong>。Server 重启、Worker 重启、区域故障恢复后，定时器依然会按时触发，因为它已经作为事件写入持久化存储。</li>\n<li><strong>定时器的触发精度是&quot;不早于&quot;</strong>。到点后还需要一次 Workflow Task 的调度与重放，因此实际恢复时间会晚于名义触发时刻几百毫秒到数秒；高精度调度不能在 Workflow 里做。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>与轮询的对比是这一节的量化重点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>等 24 小时的资源占用</th>\n<th>事件数</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>可取消</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>await sleep(&#39;24h&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>是（scope.cancel）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每秒轮询（86400 次 sleep）</td>\n<td>0（但持续唤醒）</td>\n<td>~172,800</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Activity 里 <code>setTimeout</code> 24h</td>\n<td>1 个常驻 worker 线程</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部 cron + Signal</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2 + Signal</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>轮询的致命代价不在资源而在<strong>重放成本</strong>：十几万事件会让之后每一次 Workflow Task 都重放十几万条，CPU 直接爆掉，还会撞上 51,200 事件的历史上限。这是<a href=\"../durable-execution/history-replay\">历史与重放</a>里那条上限的实际杀伤场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sleep-的四种变体与选择\">sleep 的四种变体与选择</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>await sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;)</code></td>\n<td>相对时长</td>\n<td>最常见，从当前 Task 时间起算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>await sleepUntil(date)</code></td>\n<td>绝对时刻</td>\n<td>截止日期、业务日历上的时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workflow.condition(fn, timeout)</code></td>\n<td>等条件成真，带超时</td>\n<td>等待事件，超时兜底（本质是 Signal + 定时器的组合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>await sleep(range)</code></td>\n<td>随机时长（1.29 起）</td>\n<td>避免惊群，如给 1 万条流程加 M–N 分钟的抖动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>workflow.condition</code> 是最有用的组合原语，它把&quot;等一个 Signal&quot;和&quot;等超时&quot;合并为一次确定性等待：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export async function approvalWorkflow(req: ApprovalReq): Promise&lt;Outcome&gt; {&#10;  await notifyApprover(req); // Activity&#10;&#10;  const approved = await workflow.condition(&#10;    () =&gt; decision !== undefined, // decision 由 Signal handler 设置&#10;    &#39;48 hours&#39;, // 超时&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  if (!approved) {&#10;    await escalate(req); // 超时升级&#10;    return { status: &#39;escalated&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  return decision === &#39;approve&#39; ? { status: &#39;approved&#39; } : { status: &#39;rejected&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> approvalWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApprovalReq</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Outcome</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notifyApprover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> approved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workflow.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// decision 由 Signal handler 设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">approved) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> escalate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超时升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rejected'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>condition</code> 的第一个参数必须是<strong>确定性的谓词</strong>（只读局部状态，不调外部 API），因为它在每次 Workflow Task 开始时会被重新求值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨月等待的真实陷阱\">跨月等待的真实陷阱</h2><p><strong>陷阱一：Continue-As-New 会重置定时器。</strong> 一个&quot;每年续费一次&quot;的 Workflow 若用 <code>sleep(&#39;365 days&#39;)</code>，会在中途撞上历史上限被强制切段。正确形状是<strong>短睡 + 循环 + Continue-As-New</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export async function renewalWorkflow(state: RenewalState): Promise&lt;void&gt; {&#10;  await sleepUntil(state.nextRenewalAt); // 单次等待不超过一段&#10;  await chargeRenewal(state.subId);&#10;  const next = addOneYear(state.nextRenewalAt);&#10;  await continueAsNew&lt;typeof renewalWorkflow&gt;({ ...state, nextRenewalAt: next });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> renewalWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RenewalState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleepUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.nextRenewalAt); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 单次等待不超过一段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chargeRenewal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.subId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addOneYear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.nextRenewalAt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> continueAsNew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> renewalWorkflow>({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state, nextRenewalAt: next });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样每次 run 的历史只有几十个事件，可以无限期续跑。代价是 run 链变长，按 Workflow ID 只能看到当前 run，排查要用 <code>WorkflowExecution</code> 的 run chain（见<a href=\"../versioning-ops/visibility-observability\">可见性与排障</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：日历时间不等于时长。</strong> <code>sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;)</code> 是&quot;30 × 86400 秒&quot;，遇到夏令时切换会比&quot;同一个月后的此刻&quot;差一小时；&quot;每月 1 号&quot;这类语义必须用 <code>sleepUntil</code> 配合时区计算，且时区要作为参数注入（Workflow 里不能读系统时区，那是非确定输入）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const next = Temporal.ZonedDateTime.from(new Date(workflow.now().getTime()), req.timezone)&#10;  .add({ months: 1 })&#10;  .with({ day: 1, hour: 9, minute: 0, second: 0 });&#10;await sleepUntil(next.toInstant());\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Temporal.ZonedDateTime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(workflow.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()), req.timezone)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ months: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ day: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, hour: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, minute: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, second: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleepUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(next.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toInstant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>陷阱三：改 sleep 的时长是安全的，改位置不是。</strong> 调长调短 <code>sleep</code> 的参数不破坏重放（事件类型仍是 <code>TimerStarted</code> + <code>TimerFired</code>），但在 <code>sleep</code> 前后插入新的 <code>await</code> 会改变 Command 序列，导致非确定性错误——修法见<a href=\"../versioning-ops/workflow-versioning-patching\">Workflow 版本化</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱四：超长等待需要&quot;存活证明&quot;。</strong> 有些团队会为跨年流程加一个&quot;每季度写一次心跳&quot;的 Activity，用途不是引擎需要（引擎不需要），而是<strong>组织的合规与可观测性需要</strong>：让运维能在 dashboard 上看到这个流程还活着，而不是等一年后才发现它其实早就因为某次迁移失联了。这是个业务取舍，不是技术必需，但它常被误当成技术必需。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定时器与取消\">定时器与取消</h2><p>定时器是可取消的，取消通过 <code>CancellationScope</code> 或直接 cancel Workflow 传播：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const scope = new CancellationScope();&#10;const waiter = scope.run(() =&gt; sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;));&#10;scope.cancel(); // → 历史写 TimerCanceled&#10;await waiter.catch((e) =&gt; {&#10;  /* 处理取消 */&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scope</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CancellationScope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> waiter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scope.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scope.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cancel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// → 历史写 TimerCanceled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waiter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  /* 处理取消 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>取消后历史里出现 <code>TimerCanceled</code>，重放时 <code>sleep</code> 会抛出 <code>CancelledFailure</code>。这一点与 Activity 取消的区别在于<strong>定时器的取消是立即且确定性的</strong>——它没有&quot;正在执行的工作&quot;需要协作退出，所以不需要心跳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>持久化定时器不占 Worker 资源，等待成本与时长无关，因此轮询在长等待场景下永远是错的。</li>\n<li>定时器落成 <code>TimerStarted</code>/<code>TimerFired</code> 两个事件，触发精度是&quot;不早于&quot;，不能用于高精度调度。</li>\n<li><code>sleep</code>/<code>sleepUntil</code>/<code>condition</code>/随机 <code>sleep</code> 四种变体分别对应相对时长、绝对时刻、带超时等条件、抗惊群四类需求。</li>\n<li>跨月等待用&quot;短睡 + 循环 + Continue-As-New&quot;切段，避免撞上历史上限，代价是 run chain 变长。</li>\n<li>日历语义必须用 <code>sleepUntil</code> + 注入时区，Workflow 不能读系统时区。</li>\n<li>改 <code>sleep</code> 时长安全，改其前后结构不安全；取消定时器立即生效且会写入历史。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"持久化定时器与长等待","id":"持久化定时器与长等待"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"sleep 的四种变体与选择","id":"sleep-的四种变体与选择"},{"level":2,"text":"跨月等待的真实陷阱","id":"跨月等待的真实陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"定时器与取消","id":"定时器与取消"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"副作用幂等与外部系统对接","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/workers-activities/idempotency-side-effects"},"next":{"title":"Signal 注入外部事件与 Query 读状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/timers-signals/signals-queries"}}